<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>Every service contract executed, issued or delivered in this State shall be made in duplicate and shall be dated and signed by the motor club issuing it. Such contract shall be countersigned by a duly authorized agent of the club, and by the party purchasing the contract. One copy of the contract shall be kept by the club and the other copy shall be delivered to the purchasing party.</p></caml:Content>